{'symbol': 'CDAY', 'date': '2021-09-17 01:00:00', 'title': 'CERIDIAN PARTNERS WITH PWC IN MAURITIUS TO DRIVE ENTERPRISE-WIDE HUMAN CAPITAL MANAGEMENT TRANSFORMATION', 'text': "EBÈNE, MAURITIUS, SEPT. 17, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CERIDIAN (NYSE: CDAY; TSX: CDAY), A GLOBAL LEADER IN HUMAN CAPITAL MANAGEMENT (HCM) TECHNOLOGY, AND PWC MAURITIUS ANNOUNCED AN ALLIANCE WHERE PWC MAURITIUS WILL PROVIDE CONSULTATION AND IMPLEMENTATION SERVICES TO ORGANISATIONS SEEKING TO OPTIMISE THEIR OPERATIONS THROUGH CERIDIAN'S AWARD-WINNING HCM PLATFORM, DAYFORCE."}